chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Loops for an advanced course: chapter 3 of the 3rd edition and today's Python"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-09-28T20:07:30; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4. Added in 1.1.0: every source opened and read again on 2026-10-01T19:38:00, sources P13 to P19 added for the definitions of the terms the chapter text used without defining them, and every number, output and error message quoted in the chapter text executed under CPython 3.12.11 and CPython 3.14.4." ;
